Name: Krypton local translation engine (Bergamot / Marian)
Short Name: krypton_bergamot
URL: https://github.com/mozilla/translations
Version: v0.6.0 at eea6e5a80aa4ddd86d9cc35ce9a65b79aa3ab96d
License: MPL-2.0, MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, Unlicense
License File: See the pinned source tree LICENSE and each component's LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
CPU inference behind the existing sandboxed on-device translation service and
TranslateKit C ABI. Built from source with the prepared clang-cl, static CRT,
CFG, CET compatibility, ASLR and NX. PCRE2 JIT, network access, file-based model
loading, file logging, GPU backends and extra engine worker threads are disabled.

Source provenance:
source-pins.json and ../deps.ini record exact revisions and archive SHA-256s for
mozilla/translations (including Marian), sentencepiece, intgemm, ssplit-cpp,
onnxjs, Eigen and PCRE2. The source tree contains the original licence notices
for embedded support libraries. No downloaded engine binary is used.

Local Modifications:
patches/native-sandbox.patch: immutable borrowed model buffers with explicit
lifetime ownership, static dependency wiring, standalone archive versioning,
parent toolchain flags and sandbox-safe file/log/error handling.
patches/vendored-iterator-warnings.patch: warning-free vendored yaml-cpp and
pathie headers (explicit iterator member types instead of the deprecated
std::iterator base, as upstream yaml-cpp 0.7; an assert-only parameter cast to
void). Applied after native-sandbox.patch.

Model provenance:
Mozilla's translations-models-v2 stable records, fetched at development time.
Released generations 3.0/3.1 match the v0.6.0 inference family; alpha records are
excluded. Individual sizes, hashes, URLs and MPL-2.0 licensing belong in the
pack manifest. No model is fetched on startup or from page content.
